#: website/public/index.html:457
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "01 · Which branch?"
msgstr "01 * que ramo?"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/index.html:458
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"“{ph0}0x5b? 0x5c?{ph1} Two jumps to the same place. Which operators are "
"these?”"
msgstr ""
"“{ph0}0x5b? 0x5c?{ph1} Dois saltos para o mesmo lugar. Que operadores são "
"estes?”"

#: website/public/index.html:462
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Look up the command IDs, then label the branch."
msgstr "Procure os IDs do comando e, em seguida, rotule a ramificação."

#: website/public/index.html:468
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Divide ÷"
msgstr "Dividir ÷"

#: website/public/index.html:472
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Multiply ×"
msgstr "Multiplicar ×"

#: website/public/index.html:477
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "02 · What do the calls do?"
msgstr "02 · O que fazem as funções chamadas?"

#. {ph0}: <strong >
#. {ph1}: </strong >
#: website/public/index.html:478
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"“100 is clear. The calls are just addresses. {ph0}Which one divides? Which "
"value goes in?{ph1}”"
msgstr ""
"\"100 é claro. As chamadas são apenas endereços. {ph0}Qual deles divide? Que"
" valor entra?{ph1}”"

#: website/public/index.html:484
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Inspect the helpers and trace the stored values."
msgstr "Inspecione as funções auxiliares e rastreie os valores armazenados."

#: website/public/index.html:494
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Divide"
msgstr "Dividir"

#: website/public/index.html:499
msgctxt "page:index.html"
