msgid ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Use REA to inspect this dinosaur game. Why does it get "
"faster? Show the speed rule, then build a small version with an adjustable "
"speed.{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Use REA para inspecionar este jogo de dinossauros. Por que "
